0003 CMakeLists: add the latent host classes to strata_engine for HIP

LatentDense/LatentA/LatentTables (latent_dense.cpp, latent_tables.cpp, latent_moe.cpp)
are added to strata_engine only under if(STRATA_ENABLE_CUDA), yet verify.cpp,
prefill.cpp, generate.cpp and peer_experts.cpp reference them in every build -> the
strata link fails on HIP. The sources only use cuda* names the compat header maps.
Drop when fixed upstream.

--- a/edge0-strata/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/edge0-strata/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -2947,3 +2947,7 @@
     target_compile_definitions(ds4_gg_bench PRIVATE STRATA_DSV41_TQ_CPU=1)
   endif()
 endif()
+
+if(STRATA_ENABLE_HIP)
+  target_sources(strata_engine PRIVATE src/core/latent_dense.cpp src/core/latent_tables.cpp src/latent/latent_moe.cpp)
+endif()
